{
  "_comment": "GM 命令按钮 item 蓝图（GMCmdItem）——GM_CmdList 滚动列表的单条命令按钮。\n由 UIScrollListComponent 对象池生成（spawnUIActor），GMConsoleHUD 的 onItemSpawned 负责：\n  1. 填充命令名（CmdLabel 文本）\n  2. 绑定点击（UIButtonComponent.onClick → 命令名填入输入框）\nzOrder 写相对层级 0~3（与 gm_panel 资产树一致），运行时由列表 zOrderLift 统一抬升对齐面板层。\nanchorOffset.y=1.2 使首项顶对齐容器（容器 h=2.7，首项中心 ≈ 顶 − item 半高）。",
  "name": "GMCmdItem",
  "baseClass": "Actor",
  "components": [
    {
      "baseClass": "UITransformComponent",
      "properties": {
        "position": [
          0,
          0,
          0
        ],
        "rotation": [
          0,
          0,
          0
        ],
        "scale": [
          1,
          1,
          1
        ],
        "anchor": "center",
        "anchorOffset": [
          0,
          1.2
        ],
        "worldWidth": 2.7,
        "worldHeight": 0.24
      }
    },
    {
      "baseClass": "CanvasUIComponent",
      "properties": {
        "markerOnly": true,
        "name": "UIMarker",
        "zOrder": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "baseClass": "UIImageComponent",
      "properties": {
        "color": "#1a1028",
        "radius": 6,
        "width": 540,
        "height": 48,
        "zOrder": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "baseClass": "UITextComponent",
      "name": "CmdLabel",
      "properties": {
        "text": "",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#e8d8a8",
        "align": "left",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 40,
        "zOrder": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "baseClass": "UIButtonComponent",
      "properties": {
        "colors": {
          "normal": "#1a1028",
          "hover": "#3a2a50",
          "pressed": "#4a3a60"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "children": []
}
